  "description": "Goats are domesticated animals known for their agility, curiosity, and sometimes mischievous behavior. They are often used in memes and internet culture as symbols of foolishness or stupidity, especially when paired with the phrase 'goat fucker'. The image of a goat lying down and looking relaxed or amused is used to visually represent the 'laughs in' part of the meme.",
